    "phrases": [
      {
        "scene": "S01",
        "text": "What if the greatest knight betrayed the very court he served?",
        "start": 0.0,
        "end": 3.66
      },
      {
        "scene": "S01",
        "text": "In Arthurian legend, Sir Lancelot was among Arthur’s greatest knights, celebrated for courage and loyalty.",
        "start": 4.28,
        "end": 11.66
      },
      {
        "scene": "S01",
        "text": "Yet his devotion to Queen Guinevere grew into a love that threatened the court itself.",
        "start": 12.36,
        "end": 18.0
      },
      {
        "scene": "S02",
        "text": "Their relationship could not remain private forever.",
        "start": 18.96,
        "end": 21.82
      },
      {
        "scene": "S02",
        "text": "In many Arthurian tellings, the very bonds that made Camelot glorious became tangled in betrayal.",
        "start": 21.82,
        "end": 29.34
      },
      {
        "scene": "S03",
        "text": "When the affair was revealed, conflict erupted among people who had once fought shoulder to shoulder.",
        "start": 30.38,
        "end": 36.3
      },
      {
        "scene": "S03",
        "text": "Loyalty divided the Round Table.",
        "start": 36.94,
        "end": 38.997
      },
      {
        "scene": "S04",
        "text": "Lancelot acted to save Guinevere, but the rescue intensified the war within Arthur’s kingdom.",
        "start": 40.16,
        "end": 46.9
      },
      {
        "scene": "S04",
        "text": "Each choice made the next disaster harder to prevent.",
        "start": 47.5,
        "end": 50.62
      },
      {
        "scene": "S05",
        "text": "While Arthur pursued the conflict, other enemies exploited the division.",
        "start": 51.486,
        "end": 56.18
      },
      {
        "scene": "S05",
        "text": "Camelot’s downfall arrived not through lack of strength, but through broken trust.",
        "start": 57.04,
        "end": 62.038
      },
      {
        "scene": "S06",
        "text": "Later retellings remember not one villain, but a tragic knot of love, honor, and duty.",
        "start": 63.54,
        "end": 68.96
      },
      {
        "scene": "S06",
        "text": "A perfect court could not contain imperfect human hearts.",
        "start": 69.74,
        "end": 73.58
      }
    ],
